---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - SaveScribd">
  <Header />
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:py-16 text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] flex-1">
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6 text-[#171717] dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed">
      <p>Last updated: November 2026</p>
      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white pt-4">1. Zero Personal Data Collection</h2>
      <p>SaveScribd does not require registration, login, or personal identifiers. We do not store email addresses, names, or payment details.</p>
      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white pt-4">2. Server Logs and Storage Lifespan</h2>
      <p>Files converted via our processing pipeline are stored temporarily in volatile cache and automatically purged within 60 minutes.</p>
      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white pt-4">3. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>We may use minimal aggregated telemetry to ensure system uptime and prevent denial-of-service abuse.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
